<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Duiker lifts half yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Duiker lifts half yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     42.2	  vs 39.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 20.0	  vs 17.0</p>
<p>    After tax income	68.09	 vs 61.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   105.24	vs 94.70</p>
<p>    Tax			 37.15	 vs 33.36</p>
<p>    Interest income (net) 11.95	 vs 5.53</p>
<p>    Distribution costs    120.89	vs 92.57</p>
<p>    Turnover		  495.12	vs 396.74</p>
<p>Div payable May 21</p>
<p>on register May 9</p>
<p>Full name: Duiker Mining Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Capital expenditure of 47.0 million rand was incurred in the period and 15.9 million has been contracted for.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
